9)// STRING ROTATION

right rotation of string: formula:k = k % len
                          substring = str.substr(len - k, k) + str.substr(0, len - k);

left rotation of string: formula:k = k % len
                         substring = str.substr(k, len - k) + str.substr(0, k);  

note: substr(start_index, length) is used to get the substring of a string.



